# Implementation Plan - Phase 0: Foundations & Architecture

# Goal Description
Initialize the Spendigo SmartCart execution environment, define the authoritative system architecture, select the technology stack to meet strict "Production-Grade" and "Canada-First" requirements, and establish the cost optimization strategy to ensure the $0-$25 CAD/mo constraint is met.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Tech Stack Selection**:
> - **Frontend**: React (Vite) with Vanilla CSS (System Rule).
> - **Mobile**: React Native (Expo).
> - **Backend**: Node.js Cloud Functions (TypeScript).
> - **Database**: Serverless PostgreSQL (Neon or Supabase) to meet "scale-to-zero".
> - **Infra**: Terraform for IaC.
> - **Hosting**: Firebase Hosting / Vercel (Free Tier).

> [!WARNING]
> **Data Residency**:
> Ensuring "Canada-only" data residency on free tiers can be challenging. We will prioritize services that offer Montreal/Toronto regions in their free or low-cost tiers (e.g., Google Cloud `northamerica-northeast1` or AWS `ca-central-1`).

